    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Merge Patients",
      "content": "<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://help.hearlink.co.uk/en/support/solutions/articles/205000050432\"></a>You can merge duplicate patient records in HearLink to keep your patient database accurate and up to date. This allows you to move all data from one patient record to another without cancelling or recreating the information.</span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Important Information:</strong></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">The source patient will be&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>deleted</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">&nbsp;once the merge is completed.</span></span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">Merging patients&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>cannot be undone</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">.</span></span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">Ensure all required information is saved on the target patient&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>before merging</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">If the source patient contains&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>NOAH data</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">, the merge cannot be completed automatically. Please contact&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>HearLink Support</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">&nbsp;so this can be resolved safely.<br></span></span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">In this article we'll cover how to:</span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">merge two patient records.</span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">review and update patient details before merging.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"color: gray;\">\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Merge patients</strong></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Navigate to <a href=\"https://help.hearlink.co.uk/en/support/solutions/articles/205000006609\"></a>the <a href=\"https://help.hearlink.co.uk/en/support/solutions/articles/205000006264\" dir=\"ltr\"></a></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>source patient</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;(the patient you want to merge and delete).&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Locate and click the&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Merge patient<img style=\"vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; margin-right: 5px; margin-left: 5px; float: none; max-width: calc(100% - 10px); text-align: center; width: 24px;\" src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205006486671/original/iHlzwJz_bOBpcz5YlV_5_hcKyQajkmiw8A.png?1770375861\" class=\"fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"205000109765\"></strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">icon</span>.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205007596760/original/Fwfv2_RfRRr9QWqkW6QZAdHPQsHr3jT7XQ.png?1771856640\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"205007596760\"></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">You will be taken to a merge screen, where a list of&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>possible duplicate patients</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">&nbsp;will be displayed.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205007596784/original/ZLAxeuFTwW-41YCUS8fuUkk7Zm3EwuNfdw.png?1771856649\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"205007596784\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">Locate the patient you want to keep as the&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Target patient</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">.</span></span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">Click the&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Merge patient</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; margin-right: 5px; margin-left: 5px; float: none; max-width: calc(100% - 10px); text-align: center; width: 24px;\" src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205006486671/original/iHlzwJz_bOBpcz5YlV_5_hcKyQajkmiw8A.png?1770375861\" class=\"fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"205000109765\">icon next to their name.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205007596798/original/FlWJ869dv6iAbPP16ey2Y6qGT374yMUJBg.png?1771856660\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"205007596798\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The source and the target patient will now be displayed side by side, showing the patient demographic information as originally entered.</span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">If required click <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Edit</strong></span> on the target patient to update any information.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205007596803/original/0SE4qhjMyaxPVp8iQKqxaakdJv1ftaQS8A.png?1771856666\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"205007596803\"></span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Save any changes before continuing.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205007596848/original/yyrZPe14UyYxq65D1l9lQ3hQLoavTSqNqw.png?1771856687\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"205007596848\"></span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Click <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Merge patients</strong></span>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205007596863/original/BG-MyWDix0xsbc3fWnuUGhee4__Z9cx3ng.png?1771856696\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"205007596863\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Follow the confirmation to complete the merge.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205007596888/original/6ZIuYugZuUvPPugMajRAXO3wqC9AleUPcw.png?1771856707\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"205007596888\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">You will be redirected to the target patients profile. All <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>related data</strong></span> will be moved to the target patient, including appointments, orders, notes, documents and communications.</span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">The source patient will then be <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>permanently deleted</strong></span>.</span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Create, Edit, Delete and Manage Email Templates",
      "content": "<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">An organisation may have multiple email templates to use across the system. An email template can have a subject, body and <a href=\"https://help.hearlink.co.uk/en/support/solutions/articles/205000043892\">documents attached</a> to it. These ad hoc email templates can be amended at point of <a href=\"https://help.hearlink.co.uk/en/support/solutions/articles/205000041124\">sending to the patient</a>. An organisation can also set up templates to use in confirmations and reminders by selecting the type when creating an email template, you choose the location in which it can be used.</span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">In this article we'll cover how to:</span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><a href=\"#createEmailTemplate\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">create an email template.</span></a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#addAttachmentEmailTemplate\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">attach documents to the template.</span></a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#understandEmailTemplates\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">understand and use email types and templates.</span></a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#editEmailTemplate\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">edit an email template.</span></a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"#deleteEmailTemplate\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">delete an email template.</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--idea\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Only users with the correct permissions can manage email templates. If you think you should have permission to perform such an action please contact the organisation owner.</span></pre>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"color: gray;\" id=\"createEmailTemplate\">\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Create an email template</strong></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Navigate to <a href=\"https://help.hearlink.co.uk/en/support/solutions/articles/205000006609\">Organisation settings</a>.&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Locate and click the&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Communication Settings</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;section of the settings.</span></span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Click the&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Edit icon<img style=\"vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 3px; margin-right: 5px; margin-left: 5px; float: none; max-width: calc(100% - 10px); text-align: center; width: 18px;\" src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205000563418/original/Ku7pWFmyYWpda39MCgIpHOJPqu3eM48Mjw.png?1753086099\" class=\"fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"205000109765\"></strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">next to&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Email Templates</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205005171333/original/nDbgKsokwCchyFvZ41D7vWPnZaF8_eTYsA.png?1768386159\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"205005171333\"></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Click the <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Create new email template</strong></span> button.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205001198865/original/xUS1j5sPjeHM5jTbHTIKLugs_1IK3CnppQ.png?1756991163\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"205001198865\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Choose an email template Type. This could be <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>General</strong></span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>General Appointment</strong></span>, <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Communication Automation</strong></span>, &nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Appointment Confirmation</strong></span> or <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Reminder</strong></span>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205007184713/original/dSnDWY7xmrnY32NvOfDlsbT4Sfxl0TFYlw.png?1771254480\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"205007184713\"></span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Complete the email template setup:</span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Enter a template <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Name</strong></span>.</span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Add an optional <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Brand</strong></span>.</span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Add a <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Subject</strong></span> title, using <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Variables</strong></span> if required.</span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Create the <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Body</strong></span> of the email template, using <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Variables</strong></span> if required.</span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Add optional uploaded documents.</span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Add an optional <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Logo</strong></span>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--idea\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Important</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">: If creating an email confirmation template that includes a form, you must add the <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>attached forms</strong></span> variable for these to be included. </span><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205005774070/original/6Yjd9jQKUd6QetVazPTV91krwIggKQAH-Q.png?1769418837\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"205005774070\"></pre>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205006731035/original/0BA5OROWqDIwbsRwC9cx1fiVe99MsOQiRg.png?1770808941\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"205006731035\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Click <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Submit</strong></span> to save the email template.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--idea\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">As you are creating the template, a preview will be viewable under the submit button</span></pre>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205001198894/original/6qiZo96m_2lkmD_1eUfOOcbIn_Cz24aJxg.png?1756991175\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"205001198894\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--idea\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">When <a href=\"https://help.hearlink.co.uk/en/support/solutions/articles/205000041124\">Sending an ad hoc email</a>, a user can edit an email before sending.</span></pre>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"color: gray;\" id=\"addAttachmentEmailTemplate\">\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Attach a document to an email template</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Multiple documents can be attached to any email template. These are then sent with the template when emailing the patient.</span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205001198865/original/xUS1j5sPjeHM5jTbHTIKLugs_1IK3CnppQ.png?1756991163\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"205001198865\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">Select the required documents from the dropdown list.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205002636584/original/UNetbttPzMigMXDP8IEF1L7jdHgMMlCJNA.png?1762076009\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"205002636584\"></span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Complete the email template and click <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Submit</strong></span> to save the email template with the documents attached..</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--idea\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">The attached documents can be removed at point of sending an email to the patient. A user can also add attachments when <a href=\"https://help.hearlink.co.uk/en/support/solutions/articles/205000041124\">sending an ad hoc email</a>.</span></pre>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"color: gray;\" id=\"understandEmailTemplates\">\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Email template types</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Email templates are categorised by purpose:</span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Confirmation</strong></span> - used for appointment confirmation emails.</span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Reminder</strong></span> - used for appointment reminder emails.</span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">General Appointment &nbsp;- used for ad hoc emails linked to a specific appointment, selected when sent directly from the patient dashboard.</span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Communication Automation</strong></span> - used for automated emails sent when specific actions are taken on appointment types.&nbsp;</span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>General</strong></span> -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">used for ad hoc emails sent directly from the patient dashboard, that are not directly tied to an appointment, such as follow ups, information requests or administrative communications.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p>\n<hr style=\"color: gray;\">\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Using Email templates</strong></span></p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">Email templates are assigned in two ways:</span></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Communication Automation, Confirmation</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">&nbsp;and&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Reminder</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">&nbsp;templates are selected within the appointment types settings.</span></span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>General</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">&nbsp;templates are selected when sending ad hoc emails from the&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Communications</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">&nbsp;section of the patient dashboard.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">Once selected, HearLink will automatically apply the correct email template based on the action being performed.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">For detailed information on using Email templates in appointment types and the patient dashboard, see these articles.</span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://help.hearlink.co.uk/en/support/solutions/articles/205000006711\">Set Patient Reminders</a>.<br></span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://help.hearlink.co.uk/en/support/solutions/articles/205000006712\">Set Patient Confirmations</a>.</span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://help.hearlink.co.uk/en/support/solutions/articles/205000055248\">Communication Automations.</a></span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://help.hearlink.co.uk/en/support/solutions/articles/205000041124\">Send ad hoc email</a>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"color: gray;\" id=\"editEmailTemplate\">\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Edit an email template</strong></span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Click the <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Edit icon</strong></span><img style=\"vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 3px; margin-right: 5px; margin-left: 5px; float: none; max-width: calc(100% - 10px); text-align: center; width: 18px;\" src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205000563418/original/Ku7pWFmyYWpda39MCgIpHOJPqu3eM48Mjw.png?1753086099\" class=\"fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"205000109765\">of the <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Email template</strong></span> you want to modify.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205001198971/original/zK3lVeFKlwNlBghEbfRET0gumKdXTWZCMQ.png?1756991414\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"205001198971\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">Update the&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Email template</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">&nbsp;as required.</span></span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Click <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Submit</strong></span> to save your changes.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"color: gray;\" id=\"deleteEmailTemplate\">\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Delete an email template</strong></span></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Locate the <span style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Delete icon</strong></span><img style=\"vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; margin-right: 5px; margin-left: 5px; margin-bottom: 3px; float: none; max-width: calc(100% - 10px); text-align: center; width: 18px;\" src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205000109765/original/981XvbjKjzBpoS7H-7OUug7QiegHu4QDKA.png?1749208617\" class=\"fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"205000109765\"> of the <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Email template</strong></span> you want to delete.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205001198975/original/ZWqk9aPBWFaACiiyADOsC1w8mevX2pl_Fw.png?1756991420\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"205001198975\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">Click the&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\"><strong>Delete</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">&nbsp;icon.</span></span></li>\n\t<li><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\">You'll be shown a warning message.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: null;\"><img src=\"https://s3-eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/euc-cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/205001198989/original/XKI9CSltY9SgzuXCDFvVefM47QXbhyF_XA.png?1756991428\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"205001198989\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Click Delete to confirm and delete the email template.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--warning\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Warning: Once an email template has been deleted this action cannot be undone. Please proceed with caution!</span></pre>\n\n<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p>\n\n<p>\n\t<br>\n</p>"
    }
  ]
}
